      "paperId": "7ac599da5f6b7f902249a9825b9322b9a10aec5d",
      "title": "Lenin and empiriocritics about matter. Is the discussion over?",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "A. Antonov",
          "authorId": "2058549643"
